From 6b85397f5246aaf22c497c48e390b7e1b2f57498 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 19:39:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] nemesis: student cuts behind NEMESIS_STUDENT_BUILD flag
 (src/nemesis.ts)

Hide Capabilities+Messaging (sidebar + palette), settings allow-list
(appearance/chat/safety/notifications/sessions/about; default tab appearance),
unmount coding status row, hide terminal statusbar button, hide git projects
toggle, school-voice intro copy.
